{"post_list": {"P3": {"number": 3, "html_dir": "dist/post/3.html", "labels": ["随笔", "技术"], "post_title": "第三篇测试：多标签文章", "post_url": "post/3.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 151, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "本文同时带有两个标签，用于验证：\n\n- 文章页脚部的多标签展示\n- 标签归档页的分类统计\n- `internote.json` 中 `label_color_dict` 的合并\n\n| 标签 | 颜色 |\n| ---- | ---- |\n| 随笔 | #7c3aed |\n| 技术 | #0969da |。", "created_at": 1790731470, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1790731470, "updated_date": "2026-09-30"}, "P2": {"number": 2, "html_dir": "dist/post/2.html", "labels": ["技术"], "post_title": "第二篇测试：Python 类型标注实践", "post_url": "post/2.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 259, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "验证代码高亮与多标签的第二篇测试文章。", "created_at": 1790731416, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1790731416, "updated_date": "2026-09-30"}}, "single_list": {"P4": {"number": 4, "html_dir": "dist/about.html", "labels": ["about"], "post_title": "关于", "post_url": "about.html", "comment_num": 0, "word_count": 175, "top": 0, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "description": "## 关于本站\n\n这是使用 [InterNote](https://github.com/interset-wq/InterNote) 搭建的个人博客，以 GitHub Issue 为写作入口。", "created_at": 1790732179, "created_date": "2026-09-30", "date_label_color": "#1f883d", "updated_at": 1790732179, "updated_date": "2026-09-30"}}, "render_cache": {"5088bac31a12b7c0de31c91980e91859d5485993d7975f9139110d2ae5836027": "<p>本文同时带有两个标签，用于验证：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文章页脚部的多标签展示</li>\n<li>标签归档页的分类统计</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">internote.json</code> 中 <code class=\"notranslate\">label_color_dict</code> 的合并</li>\n</ul>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签</th>\n<th>颜色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>随笔</td>\n<td>#7c3aed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术</td>\n<td>#0969da</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>", "3b252a2c647d6e0677fe581f138d7d48f24beadde45c8688c51b0dd7dcfd2258": "<p>验证代码高亮与多标签的第二篇测试文章。</p>\n<h2>类型标注</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-python\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">from</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">dataclasses</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">import</span> <span class=\"pl-s1\">dataclass</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-en\">@<span class=\"pl-s1\">dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">class</span> <span class=\"pl-v\">Post</span>:\n    <span class=\"pl-s1\">number</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">int</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-s1\">title</span>: <span class=\"pl-smi\">str</span>\n\n    <span class=\"pl-k\">def</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">url</span>(<span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>) <span class=\"pl-c1\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">str</span>:\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">return</span> <span class=\"pl-s\">f\"/post/<span class=\"pl-s1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">self</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">number</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></span>.html\"</span></pre></div>\n<h2>配置示例</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-toml\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">[<span class=\"pl-en\">site</span>]\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">title</span> = <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>InterNote<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">utc</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">8</span></pre></div>", "71653a722ba4c841ed53ad31108a4d3f0334d8c595ad83c9d30493da8f24ca52": "<h2>关于本站</h2>\n<p>这是使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/interset-wq/InterNote\">InterNote</a> 搭建的个人博客，以 GitHub Issue 为写作入口。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文章即 Issue，推送即发布</li>\n<li>评论由 giscus 提供（基于 GitHub Discussions）</li>\n<li>本站于 2026-09-30 建站</li>\n</ul>"}}